    _definition.scope            Category
    _definition.class            Set
    _definition.update           2026-03-09
    _description.text
;
    Data items in the SIMLTN category record computational method
    details for simulated isotherms (e.g. GCMC, MD). Only relevant
    when the data originates from molecular simulation rather than
    experiment.
;
save_

